    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned that the argument about tuition inflation often lacks empirical evidence. Could you expand on that? I want to make sure I'm representing the opposition correctly in my piece—are there any specific studies or economic theories they point to, or is it strictly a political talking point?",
